EyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM1OTA4Mzc1OQ==","user":{"login":"ras0219-msft","id":12301622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzAxNjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12301622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft","html_url":"https://github.com/ras0219-msft","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-01-19T20:44:00Z","updated_at":"2018-01-19T20:44:00Z","body":"@bitkoda Just to be clear -- the \"before\" screen you posted seems fine given this series of events:\r\n```\r\n>vcpkg remove --outdated --recurse\r\n>vcpkg list\r\n>// take screenshot \"before\"\r\n>vcpkg install boost-asio\r\n>vcpkg list\r\n>// take screenshot \"after\"\r\n```\r\nSometimes we need to tweak individual boost sublibraries, which means they don't _all_ need to be uninstalled (another benefit of modularizing! 😄).\r\n\r\n@cenit That definitely sounds like a bug -- you should ideally never get the \"File xxx should be overwritten\" except if a very, very, very rare race condition triggers with Ctrl-C.\r\n\r\nCould you start backing up your `installed\\vcpkg` folder before upgrading? This is the folder that contains the full \"database\" of installed information, such as what files belong to what and what packages are installed.\r\n\r\nIf you are able to reproduce strange behavior like this, please mail us the before/during/after at vcpkg@microsoft.com!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/comments/359083759/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ras0219-msft","id":12301622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzAxNjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12301622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft","html_url":"https://github.com/ras0219-msft","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1433208527,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MTQzMzIwODUyNw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/events/1433208527","actor":null,"event":"mentioned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2018-01-19T20:44:00Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":1433208529,"node_id":"MDE1OlN1YnNjcmliZWRFdmVudDE0MzMyMDg1Mjk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/events/1433208529","actor":null,"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2018-01-19T20:44:00Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":1433208533,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MTQzMzIwODUzMw=="